"\n"
"វាក្យសម្ពន្ធ URL ៖\n"
"  file:///path/file              ឯកសារ​មេឌៀ​ធម្មតា\n"
"  http://host[:port]/file        HTTP URL\n"
"  ftp://host[:port]/file         FTP URL\n"
"  mms://host[:port]/file         MMS URL\n"
"  screen://                      ថត​រូប​អេក្រង់\n"
"  dvd://[device]                 ឧបករណ៍​ឌីវីឌី\n"
